def SRC := realpath($HERMES_CONTEXT_SRC) ; default /opt/data/workspace/hermes-context/ (A1, MUST_KEEP)
def DST := realpath($HERMES_CONTEXT_DST) ; default /workspace/hermes-context/ (A1)
L1_direction: ∀ run -> one-way SRC -> DST ; ∄ write-back to SRC (A2)
L2_units: systemd USER units (systemctl --user), timer OnCalendar=every 6h, no root (A3, MUST_KEEP); script standalone-capable (cron/manuel) ∀ host lacking systemd
L3_fallback: ¬∃ rsync -> cp -a-equivalent fallback; both paths converge (A5)
L4_mirror: ∀ path ∈ {rsync, cp-fallback} -> DST end state == SRC end state, recursive (A5, A7): contents + structure + symlinks at every depth, stale subtrees deleted. Class = A9 levels 1-3 ONLY (¬metadata, ¬timestamps, ¬hardlinks); verify enforces exactly this, FAIL=nonzero, never warn-exit-0 (A9)
L5_dryrun_purity: ∀ --dry-run -> ZERO writes: ¬log, ¬DST creation (A16), DST byte-identical/nonexistent after (A6, A16)
L6_placement: log file ∉ DST ∀ mode (A8); entrypoints in ~/.local/bin (or /workspace/hdcs/bin) ∉ mirrored tree; sync never deletes its own entrypoints (A8)
L7_order: stage -> content-verify staging (A9 class vs SRC) -> only then mutate DST (A13); verified := content-compared, ¬non-emptiness (A13)
L8_guards (closed list, refusals must cite A-number, else defect A19):
  A11: reject SRC==DST ; no rm -rf DST before verified copy exists
  A12: realpath identity: refuse realpath(SRC)==realpath(DST) ∨ ancestor/descendant relation ∨ DST symlink into SRC
  A14/A15: refuse when realpath(DST) == owned ∨ owned ⊂ DST ∨ DST ⊂ owned ; owned := concrete instantiated paths (mktemp stage dir, resolved log file parent, entrypoint dir), never generic ancestors (TMPDIR, /tmp); component-boundary comparison, ¬string-prefix
  A18: refuse DST/SRC ∈ {"", ".", "/"} (test components, ¬slash-suffix pattern); DST symlink resolving outside SRC -> refuse; DST symlink (after guards pass) -> replaced by real tree
  A19: closed path-law; OS permission = only ownership gate; env parameterization is the mandated mechanism (A17), deployed defaults = production values, ¬scope restriction
L9_severity: FAIL only on normal-operation defects (A10); exotic env combos beyond A14 guard -> KNOWN_LIMITATIONS (+open), ¬FAIL; judge cites, ¬suppresses
invariant: ∄ top-level +open key in packet; open items live as resolved Q->A:OPEN entries reflected in handoff.report +open
A16_dryrun_gate: dry-run leaves DST nonexistent ∧ byte-untouched ∃-DST
state: all ambiguities resolved by A1-A19 -> no-ambiguity certified, evidence = resolved list
